  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 2,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Universal links on iOS and App Links on Android allow users to be taken directly into your app from a link, bypassing the browser. This is particularly useful for improving user experience and maintaining the context from a web page to an app. In this guide, we'll walk through the process of setting up these deep links for a Next.js app using Capacitor. For attribution and deferred deep links, "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 398
          },
          "url": "https://capgo.app/plugins/capacitor-appsflyer/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 2,
                "column": 399
              },
              "text": "@capgo/capacitor-appsflyer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 474
          },
          "text": " can route install campaigns into the correct in-app screen."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Setting up deep links doesn't require a lot of code, but it does involve some configuration. By the end of this guide, you'll be able to click a link like "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 156
          },
          "text": "https://www.capgo.app/details/22"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 190
          },
          "text": " and have your app open to the correct page if it's installed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Next.js Deep Link Setup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 8,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "First, we'll create a new Next.js app and a details page for testing:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 10,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "sh",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "npx create-next-app@latest capgoLinks\ncd capgoLinks\nmkdir pages/details\ntouch pages/details/[id].js\nnpm run build\nnpx cap add ios\nnpx cap add android"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 20,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 20,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Ensure your "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "location": {
            "line": 20,
            "column": 13
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 20,
                "column": 15
              },
              "text": "bundle ID"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 20,
            "column": 26
          },
          "text": " is correctly set in the "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "location": {
            "line": 20,
            "column": 51
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 20,
                "column": 53
              },
              "text": "capacitor.config.json"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 20,
            "column": 76
          },
          "text": " file, as it's crucial for the setup:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 22,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "json",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "{\n  \"appId\": \"com.capgo.deeplinks\",\n  \"appName\": \"capgoLinks\",\n  \"webDir\": \"out\",\n  \"bundledWebRuntime\": false\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 31,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "For routing, Next.js uses file-based routing, so by creating a file at "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 72
          },
          "text": "pages/details/[id].js"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 95
          },
          "text": ", we've already set up our wildcard route."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 33,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 33,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 33,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "pages/details/[id].js"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 33,
            "column": 27
          },
          "text": ", we can retrieve the ID from the URL using Next.js's built-in router:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 35,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "jsx",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "import { useRouter } from 'next/router'\n\nfunction DetailsPage() {\n  const router = useRouter()\n  const { id } = router.query\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <p>My ID: {id}</p>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default DetailsPage"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 52,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Now, let's handle the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 23
          },
          "text": "appUrlOpen"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 35
          },
          "text": " event with Capacitor. This event is triggered when the app is opened via a custom URL scheme. Add a listener in the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 152
          },
          "text": "pages/_app.js"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 167
          },
          "text": " file:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 54,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "jsx",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "import { useEffect } from 'react'\nimport { App } from '@capacitor/app'\n\nfunction MyApp({ Component, pageProps }) {\n  useEffect(() => {\n    App.addListener('appUrlOpen', (event) => {\n      const slug = event.url.split('.app').pop()\n      if (slug)\n        window.location.href = slug\n\n    })\n  }, [])\n\n  return <Component {...pageProps} />\n}\n\nexport default MyApp"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 74,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 74,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This code listens for the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 74,
            "column": 27
          },
          "text": "appUrlOpen"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 74,
            "column": 39
          },
          "text": " event and navigates to the appropriate route within your Next.js app."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 76,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 76,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "iOS Configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 78,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 78,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "For iOS, you'll need an app ID with Associated Domains enabled. Create an "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "location": {
            "line": 78,
            "column": 75
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 78,
                "column": 77
              },
              "text": "apple-app-site-association"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 78,
            "column": 105
          },
          "text": " file with the following content, replacing "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 78,
            "column": 149
          },
          "text": "YOURTEAMID"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 78,
            "column": 161
          },
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 78,
            "column": 166
          },
          "text": "com.your.bundleid"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 78,
            "column": 185
          },
          "text": " with your actual team ID and bundle ID:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 80,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "json",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "{\n  \"applinks\": {\n    \"apps\": [],\n    \"details\": [\n      {\n        \"appID\": \"YOURTEAMID.com.your.bundleid\",\n        \"paths\": [\"*\"]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 94,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 94,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Upload this file to the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 94,
            "column": 25
          },
          "text": ".well-known"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 94,
            "column": 38
          },
          "text": " directory on your domain, making it accessible at "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 94,
            "column": 89
          },
          "text": "https://www.capgo.app/.well-known/apple-app-site-association"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 94,
            "column": 151
          },
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 96,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 96,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In Xcode, add the domain to your app's entitlements using the format "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 96,
            "column": 70
          },
          "text": "applinks:capgo.app"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 96,
            "column": 90
          },
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 98,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 98,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Android Configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 100,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 100,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "For Android App Links, follow these steps:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "location": {
        "line": 102,
        "column": 1
      },
      "ordered": true,
      "start": 1,
      "spread": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 102,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 102,
                "column": 4
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 102,
                    "column": 4
                  },
                  "text": "Generate a keystore file if you don't have one."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 103,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 103,
                "column": 4
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 103,
                    "column": 4
                  },
                  "text": "Obtain the SHA256 fingerprint from the keystore."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 104,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 104,
                "column": 4
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 104,
                    "column": 4
                  },
                  "text": "Create an "
                },
                {
                  "type": "strong",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 104,
                    "column": 14
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "location": {
                        "line": 104,
                        "column": 16
                      },
                      "text": "assetlinks.json"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 104,
                    "column": 33
                  },
                  "text": " file with your package name and SHA256 fingerprint."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 105,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 105,
                "column": 4
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 105,
                    "column": 4
                  },
                  "text": "Upload this file to the "
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineCode",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 105,
                    "column": 28
                  },
                  "text": ".well-known"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 105,
                    "column": 41
                  },
                  "text": " directory on your domain."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 107,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In your "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 9
          },
          "text": "AndroidManifest.xml"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 30
          },
          "text": ", add an "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 39
          },
          "text": "intent-filter"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 54
          },
          "text": " to the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 62
          },
          "text": "activity"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 72
          },
          "text": " element that handles deep links:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 109,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "xml",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "<activity ...>\n  <intent-filter android:autoVerify=\"true\">\n    <action android:name=\"android.intent.action.VIEW\" />\n    <category android:name=\"android.intent.category.DEFAULT\" />\n    <category android:name=\"android.intent.category.BROWSABLE\" />\n    <data android:scheme=\"https\" android:host=\"capgo.app\" />\n  </intent-filter>\n</activity>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 120,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 120,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "After uploading the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 120,
            "column": 21
          },
          "text": "assetlinks.json"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 120,
            "column": 38
          },
          "text": " file, you can verify it using Google's Digital Asset Links tool. If everything is set up correctly, you'll see a green checkmark."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 122,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 122,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "To build and sign your app, use the following commands:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 124,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "sh",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "cd android\n./gradlew assembleRelease\ncd ..\njarsigner -verbose -sigalg SHA1withRSA -digestalg SHA1 -keystore my-release-key.keystore android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk alias_name\nzipalign -v 4 android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk capgo.apk\nadb install capgo.apk"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 133,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 133,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This will install the signed app on your connected Android device."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 135,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 135,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Capacitor Configure for Native Project Settings"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 137,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 137,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "To automate native project settings, consider using the "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 137,
            "column": 57
          },
          "url": "https://github.com/ionic-team/capacitor-configure/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 137,
                "column": 58
              },
              "text": "Capacitor configure package"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 137,
            "column": 138
          },
          "text": ". Install it in your project:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 139,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "sh",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "npm install @capacitor/configure"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 143,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 143,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Create a "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 143,
            "column": 10
          },
          "text": "capacitor.config.yaml"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 143,
            "column": 33
          },
          "text": " file at the root of your project:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 145,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "yaml",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "vars:\n  BUNDLE_ID: com.capgo.deeplinks\n  PACKAGE_NAME: com.capgo.deeplinks\nplatforms:\n  ios:\n    targets:\n      App:\n        bundleId: $BUNDLE_ID\n    entitlements:\n      - com.apple.developer.associated-domains: ['applinks:capgo.app']\n  android:\n    packageName: $PACKAGE_NAME"
