        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 170,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Setting up deep links with Capacitor for a Next.js app involves configuring your domain and project settings for both iOS and Android. While the process requires attention to detail, it's streamlined compared to older methods and doesn't require additional plugins. Ensure your domain verification files are correctly served and check them with the respective platform tools. Once set up, your app will seamlessly open from web links, providing a smooth transition for your users from web to app."
        }
